<p><b>Full name:</b> Drakang Vondraconis


<br><b>Profile:</b>
Level 54 Male Teir Dal Shadow Knight


<br><b>Religion:</b>
Innoruuk

<br><b>Hord Rank:</b>
Bone Guard



<p><b>Drakang's Bio:</b>
<table border=1 width=400>
  <tr><td>
  Many years ago there was a powerful Enchantress that had roamed the world.  She had been places no Tier Dal had visited before.  On one of these trips to an icy land she attracted the attention of a powerful dragon.  When all of her spells and charms failed her, she stood before the dragon defiantly awaiting death, when her final charm that of being a beautiful and strong woman worked where all else had failed.  The Dragon's form slowly shifted to that of a Tier Dal male and he came to her.  From this union were born twin males.  To all apperances they were pure blood Tier Dal.  Yet some strange power sang to them from within.  Their mother would never tell them who their father was and so they were taunted as bastard children with a whore for a mother.  The hate grew within each of them from this.  The mother took the slighter of the two and sent him to the enchanters guild to learn her art.  The Hate was so strong in the other she handed him a sword and sent him forth into the world to see if his hate and his dragon blood would sustain him.  He slew everthing that stood in his way.  He attracted the attention of a powerful necromancer named Moorefallen who brought him into a group known as the Tower of Hate.  Here he found friends that shared his hate and didn't care about his background.  He became legend among them for his bravery.  Moorefallen taught him the powers of the necromancer, but even tho he excelled at them the were never equal to his skill at combat. So he was guided into the ranks of the Shadow Knights. Upon reaching his 20th season as a Shadow knight his mother called him home and revealed his heritage to him.  She told him she would not reveal his fathers name but that if he was strong enough and powerful enough his dragon blood would call to him and lead him to his fathers land.  She told him that there were many factions of dragon in the lands but he would know his fathers because he would find himself unable to raise sword against his own blood.  Drakang walked forth that day to be know as Drakang Vondraconis.  Proclaiming to the world his heritage.  All that have laughed at his claim are now dead or have begged his forgiveness.  His power grew until Moorefallen invited him into the inner circle of the Tower of Hate.  Then Moorefallen who will forevermore be known as the "traitor who broke the tower" broke with the ways of Innoruuk.  He lost faith in the power of hate and invited those of the light into the tower because he no longer believed the power of evil was enough to conquer all.  Drakang berated him publicly before the assembled tower.  He then stalked off never to set foot in the tower of hate again.  Many followed him out that day but unfortunatly many were swayed by the traitor and remained behind.
	Drakangs Hate grew and none could stand before his sword.  He left a wake of carnage across all the lands.  Till one day he heard a small gnome calling to him about a land of opportunity and ice that had just been discovered.  His blood sang to him that he must travel to this place.  He knew here he would find his father and if his sword was strong enough and his mind powerful enough that maybe he would stand one day before his father and finally be acknowledged as dragonkin.  It was in this land that he met a fellow Tier Dal Shadow Knight named Zherron and a female Iskar Shaman named Razorr slaying giants.  He joined with them and together they turned the ice red with the blood of the giants they slew.  When finally they rested because they could find no more giants to slay Zherron spoke to him of a horde of the evil races that still followed the true path of evil and hate.  He said that the members of the horde were to be recognized by the trail of bloody victims they left in their wake and thus they were called the Bloodhorde.  Drakang sought out the leader of this Bloodhorde and pledged his sword and soul to the Horde.   Now he again has those he calls brother and sister as he continues the quest to find the one who sired him and force him to recognize him as his blood.
  </td></tr>
</table>



